    "| 04 | Fit logistic regression | What are the model coefficients and signs? |\n",
    "| 05 | Validation & calibration | How well does the model discriminate and calibrate? |\n",
    "| 06 | Segment validation | Does the model perform consistently by grade, tenure? |\n",
    "| 07 | Save model & artifacts | Model card, joblib, and CSV tables |\n",
    "| 08 | Governance & caveats | What assumptions underpin this model? |"
   ]
  },
